  lines:
  - <?MementoTalk><bounce>Well, here's my room!</bounce>
  - <?MementoTalk><wiggle>I know it's a bit messy</wiggle>
  - <?MementoTalk><wave>But take a seat wherever you like!</wave>
  - <?PlayerTalk><wave>Did you make all of these?</wave>
  - <?MementoTalk><bounce>Anything with the funny mouth, yep!</bounce>
  - <?MementoTalk><bounce>Mom and dad say I'm pretty good too!</bounce>
  - <?PlayerTalk>Must be nice...
  - <?GoToLevel2> \n
